 r←Test_Input_DataType_009(stopFlag batchFlag);n;⎕TRAP;defMat;res;DT;globalParms;parms;props;month;values;colors;Okay
⍝ Exercise "Input" with data type "Numeric".
 r←∆Failed
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')

 DT←#.APLGUI.APLGUI.Enums.InputDataTypes

 defMat←0 5⍴0
 defMat⍪←'Number1' 'Test' '100.23'DT.Numeric 30
 defMat⍪←'Number2' 'Number' 200.23 DT.Numeric 30
 defMat⍪←'Number3' 'Undefiend1'⍬ DT.Numeric 3
 defMat⍪←'Number4' 'Undefiend2' ''DT.Numeric 3

 globalParms←∆GetGlobalParms
 parms←#.APLGUI.APLGUI.Input.CreateParms
 parms.posn←50 50
 parms.addToCaption←'No. ',⍕∆GetTestCaseNo

 n←#.APLGUI.APLGUI.Input.Create defMat globalParms parms
 n.Number1.SelText←0 20
 n.Number1 ∆KeyPress'456'
 0 ∆Process n.∆Form
 →GoToTidyUp n.Number1.Value≠456

 ⎕NQ n.∆OK'Select'
 0 ∆Process n.∆Form
 →GoToTidyUp 456≠↑n.∆result[n.∆result[;0]⍳⊂'Number1';1]
 →GoToTidyUp 656.23≠+/n.∆result[;1]

 r←∆OK

∆TidyUp:
 n.∆CloseForm
